---@field logGroupArnList aws.cloudwatch_logs.LogGroupArnList An array of ARNS of the log groups that contained log events considered to be part of this anomaly.
---@field suppressed? aws.cloudwatch_logs.Boolean Indicates whether this anomaly is currently suppressed. To suppress an anomaly, use UpdateAnomaly.
---@field suppressedDate aws.cloudwatch_logs.EpochMillis If the anomaly is suppressed, this indicates when it was suppressed.
---@field suppressedUntil aws.cloudwatch_logs.EpochMillis If the anomaly is suppressed, this indicates when the suppression will end. If this value is 0, the anomaly was suppressed with no expiration, with the INFINITE value.
---@field isPatternLevelSuppression? aws.cloudwatch_logs.Boolean If this anomaly is suppressed, this field is true if the suppression is because the pattern is suppressed. If false, then only this particular anomaly is suppressed.

