---@class aws.cloudwatch_logs.GetQueryResultsResponse
---@field queryLanguage? aws.cloudwatch_logs.QueryLanguage The query language used for this query. For more information about the query languages that CloudWatch Logs supports, see Supported query languages.
---@field results? aws.cloudwatch_logs.QueryResults The log events that matched the query criteria during the most recent time it ran.
